    "text": "M31 (q milestone 7: 1e60 total quirks, then Auto-Space Buildings switched on) is not reached by the cap: 5.98e51 total quirks at 130,000 game-s, 10^8.2 short (the table before climb-1: 1.99e51). Over the last legs total quirks grow about 10^0.48 per 4,000 game-s (1.99e51 at 126,000 → 5.98e51), so at that pace M31 is ~68,000 game-s further; the 11th Quirk Layer, the next step of the quirk-energy exponent, costs 1.75^(1.75^10−1) ≈ 1e65 quirks — past the goal itself. In template terms: a VALUE goal (player.q.total ≥ 1e60) whose producer is the q reset's gain, which no template prices; time-priced-purchase's lever on q34 (total quirks) is spent; More Layers (q43) and Improvements Galore (q44, M32) are bought."
